          "body": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nThank you for your offer and for explaining your position.\n\nOur data shows a different picture on some points:\nProducer prices DE: electric power generation, transmission and distribution changed -6.1% from 2025-11 to 2026-08 (idx:PPI-D351@2025-11, idx:PPI-D351@2026-08).\nYour rolling scorecard shows on-time delivery of 88.5% (sc:70340@2026Q3).\nOur demand forecast for this part has risen 2.3% (fc:330030@2026-09).\n\nPlease find our proposal below.\n\nWe look forward to your reply.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
